# One-off QA, audit, and design-study artefacts. Anchored to the repo root,
# where no HTML is ever tracked — the apps' own HTML lives under apps/*.
# Ignored rather than merely left uncommitted because a stray `git add -A`,
# or lint-staged restoring its stash, will otherwise sweep them into an
# unrelated commit.
/*.html
/qa-audit-*/
/tokens.css
/ACCOUNTS.md
.hallmark/

# scratch canvases from AI tooling
*_canvas.html
